  - kind: AutomaticTaskInput
    propertyName: item.'new_PatientID@odata.bind'
    description: "The Patient record GUID, formatted as an OData bind reference: /new_patients(<guid>). For example, if the GUID is a1d351d0-2a6c-f111-ab0d-000d3a5b0c32, the value must be /new_patients(a1d351d0-2a6c-f111-ab0d-000d3a5b0c32). Do not pass the raw GUID alone."

